	(text "XM125 radar water-level sensor. VBAT -> U2 1.8 V LDO, EN = VSENS: the module is unpowered while the host has VSENS off.\nXM125 VIN and 1V8 both on +1V8 (single 1.8 V supply, datasheet 3.1), so all module I/O is 1.8 V.\nU3 (I2C), U4 (WAKE_UP), U5 (MCU_INT): Ioff / VCC isolation, high-Z when either supply is off -> no back-powering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 12.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "691ecbd4-e567-475a-bc14-352767f155b9")
	)
	(text "U3 channels swapped on purpose for layout: SDA_A/SDA_B carry SCL, SCL_A/SCL_B carry SDA\n(the two TCA9406 channels are identical open-drain translators)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 101.6 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "71172f8a-d15c-4e1c-a3ae-a1759e0cb0b8")
	)
	(text "RADAR_RST high = XM125 held in reset (Q1 open drain on NRESET). The STM32 has its own NRST pull-up.\nThis board needs the radar feather build: R15, R16, R17, R18 not fitted (Sensor_Boards\CN1_SENSOR_CONNECTOR.md).\nOn that build R2 keeps Q1 off while the host pin floats. On a standard feather R18 holds RADAR_RST at about 2.7 V,\nso the module stays in reset until firmware drives SENS_CS low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 20.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "a5d51153-b3bd-4d7c-a0e8-5151807d1608")
	)
	(text "Test pads TP1-TP8 (bottom side, 1.8 V): flash the Acconeer I2C distance detector\nvia ROM bootloader (TP4 BOOT0 to TP7 1V8, pulse TP3 NRST, 1.8 V USB-UART on TP5 TX / TP6 RX)\nor via SWD (TP1/TP2/TP3, debugger set to 1.8 V). I2C_ADDRESS open = 0x52.\nBench power with the FFC out: TP10 VBAT 3.0-4.2 V, TP9 VSENS 3.0 V, TP8 GND (TP9 and TP10 are on the root sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 154.94 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "67c0b2f0-9438-4b17-b209-104677cddd57")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
